                <pb facs="0598" n="1332" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1332"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-31"><hi rendition="#italic">October 31,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Telegram from Moush that moutessarif promises safety for missionaries in Sassoun.
                    Have telegraphed them to decide for themselves about leaving.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
